{"seq":2,"slug":"color-contrast","title":"色彩与对比度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/perception/color-contrast","wordCount":1317,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"色彩与对比度\">色彩与对比度</h1><p>设计稿上那行优雅的浅灰小字,在阳光下的手机屏上、在低视力用户眼里,可能根本读不出来。色彩相关的可访问性问题有个特点:它们对设计师和年轻健康的开发者「看起来没问题」,却把相当一部分用户挡在门外。低视力用户占人群相当比例,色觉差异更是约影响 8% 的男性。把「看得清」从主观感受变成可计算的数字,正是对比度标准存在的意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>对比度(contrast ratio)衡量前景(通常是文字)与背景之间的明暗差异,取值从 1:1(完全相同,不可读)到 21:1(纯黑配纯白)。它服务于<a href=\"../foundations/a11y-user-model\">基础章 POUR 的「可感知」原则</a>:信息必须能被看清。这与另一条独立的原则——「不能仅靠颜色传达信息」——共同构成色彩可访问性的两大支柱,二者解决的是不同问题,缺一不可。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[色彩可访问性] --&gt; B[对比度足够&lt;br/&gt;看得清]&#10;  A --&gt; C[不仅靠颜色&lt;br/&gt;区分得开]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[文本对背景 WCAG 阈值]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[UI 组件与焦点环对比]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[错误不只用红色]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[链接不只靠颜色&lt;br/&gt;加下划线]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[图表加图案/标签]\">flowchart TD\n  A[色彩可访问性] --&gt; B[对比度足够&lt;br/&gt;看得清]\n  A --&gt; C[不仅靠颜色&lt;br/&gt;区分得开]\n  B --&gt; B1[文本对背景 WCAG 阈值]\n  B --&gt; B2[UI 组件与焦点环对比]\n  C --&gt; C1[错误不只用红色]\n  C --&gt; C2[链接不只靠颜色&lt;br/&gt;加下划线]\n  C --&gt; C3[图表加图案/标签]</pre><h2 id=\"wcag-的对比度阈值\">WCAG 的对比度阈值</h2><p>WCAG 2.2 用具体数字规定了最低对比度,工程师需要记住这几个阈值:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类型</th>\n<th>AA 级要求</th>\n<th>AAA 级要求</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通文本</td>\n<td>≥ 4.5:1</td>\n<td>≥ 7:1</td>\n<td>小于 18pt 或 14pt 加粗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大号文本</td>\n<td>≥ 3:1</td>\n<td>≥ 4.5:1</td>\n<td>≥ 18pt 或 14pt 加粗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 组件与图形</td>\n<td>≥ 3:1</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>按钮边框、图标、焦点环、表单边框</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意第三行常被忽视:WCAG 1.4.11 要求按钮边框、图标、表单输入框的边界、以及<a href=\"../aria/keyboard-focus\">键盘焦点环</a>本身,都要对背景有至少 3:1 的对比。一个淡到几乎看不见的焦点环虽然「存在」,但不达标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对比度是怎么算的\">对比度是怎么算的</h2><p>对比度公式基于「相对亮度(relative luminance)」。先把每个颜色通道的 sRGB 值归一化并做伽马校正,得到相对亮度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2126</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.7152</mn><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.0722</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 0.2126 R + 0.7152 G + 0.0722 B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2126</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7152</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0722</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R, G, B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是经过线性化的通道值。三个系数不相等,反映人眼对绿光最敏感、蓝光最迟钝。得到前景亮度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与背景亮度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1 \\ge L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)后,对比度为:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ratio</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ratio} = \\frac{L_1 + 0.05}{L_2 + 0.05}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ratio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子分母都加 0.05 是为了模拟环境光,避免纯黑时分母为零。这个公式可以手算,但实践中用工具:浏览器开发者工具的取色器会直接显示对比度并标注是否通过 AA/AAA,设计阶段则用 Stark、Contrast 等插件实时检查。这些检查能被纳入<a href=\"../engineering/automation-ci\">自动化流水线</a>批量扫描——对比度正是少数能被机器可靠判定的准则之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"apca-下一代对比度算法\">APCA:下一代对比度算法</h2><p>WCAG 2.x 的对比度公式有公认缺陷:它对深色背景(暗色模式)和不同字重的判定不够准,有时把人眼明明读得清的组合判为不合格,反之亦然。<strong>APCA(Accessible Perceptual Contrast Algorithm)</strong> 是为 WCAG 3.0 研发的新算法,它考虑字号、字重与极性(深底浅字还是浅底深字),给出更贴近人眼感知的分数(来源:WCAG 3.0 工作草案)。</p>\n<p>APCA 的输出不是比率而是一个带方向的分值(Lc,Lightness contrast),阈值随字号字重浮动而非一刀切。它目前随 <a href=\"../foundations/wcag-standards\">WCAG 3.0</a> 仍在演进,<strong>尚不能作为合规依据</strong>——生产项目的验收仍以 WCAG 2.2 的比率为准。但了解 APCA 有现实价值:做暗色模式时,WCAG 2.x 公式常给出反直觉结果,这时用 APCA 辅助判断能避免「数字达标但实际难读」或「数字不达标但实际清晰」的困境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不能仅靠颜色传达信息\">不能仅靠颜色传达信息</h2><p>这是与对比度完全独立的一条准则(WCAG 1.4.1),却同样关键。色觉差异用户无法区分红绿,因此任何「用颜色编码含义」的设计都必须有第二重线索:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>表单错误不能只把边框变红,要配文字说明与图标(并通过 <a href=\"../aria/aria-roles\"><code>aria-describedby</code></a> 关联,让<a href=\"screen-readers\">屏幕阅读器</a>也能获知)。</li>\n<li>正文里的链接不能只靠颜色区别于普通文字,要加下划线或其他非颜色标识。</li>\n<li>图表里不同数据系列不能只靠颜色,要加图案、形状或直接标注。</li>\n<li>「红=失败、绿=成功」的状态指示要配图标或文字。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个简单的自检法:把页面截图转成灰度,如果某个信息此时无法分辨,它就违反了这条准则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>对比度衡量前景与背景的明暗差,服务「可感知」原则;它与「不仅靠颜色」是两条独立且都必须满足的准则。</li>\n<li>WCAG 2.2 阈值:普通文本 4.5:1、大文本 3:1、UI 组件与焦点环 3:1(AA 级);焦点环对比常被遗漏。</li>\n<li>对比度由相对亮度按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{L_1+0.05}{L_2+0.05}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3335em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.05</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算,实践中用开发者工具与设计插件检查,可纳入自动化扫描。</li>\n<li>APCA 是为 <a href=\"../foundations/wcag-standards\">WCAG 3.0</a> 研发的感知型新算法,适合辅助暗色模式判断,但暂不作为合规依据。</li>\n<li>永远提供颜色之外的第二线索;灰度截图自检能快速发现「仅靠颜色」的违规。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"色彩与对比度","id":"色彩与对比度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WCAG 的对比度阈值","id":"wcag-的对比度阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"对比度是怎么算的","id":"对比度是怎么算的"},{"level":2,"text":"APCA:下一代对比度算法","id":"apca-下一代对比度算法"},{"level":2,"text":"不能仅靠颜色传达信息","id":"不能仅靠颜色传达信息"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"屏幕阅读器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/perception/screen-readers"},"next":{"title":"响应式与动效偏好","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/perception/responsive-motion"}}